# Response Format
Answer with the line ranges of the main content, each written as `start-end` (both inclusive) and enclosed in single backticks, e.g. `12-57`. Usually one range suffices. Give several ranges only if the main content is interrupted by clutter, e.g. `12-40` `46-57`, or if the media of a post are separated from its text.

Do not rewrite, summarize or quote any content; the lines are taken over exactly as they are. If the scrape contains no main content at all (e.g. only an error message or a login wall), answer `none`.

